      "TopText": "\u628A\u4E0A\u4E00\u500B\u7BC0\u9EDE\u7684\u5167\u5BB9\u7FFB\u8B6F\u6210\u82F1\u6587",
      "BottomText": "National Taipei University of Education (NTUE), founded in 1895, is Taiwan\u2019s first educational institution and is located in Da\u2019an District, Taipei City. Originally established as the Shihsanyen Academy, it underwent several name changes during the Japanese colonial period. It was upgraded to a teachers college in 1994 and officially became a university in 2005. Today, it comprises multiple colleges and is a comprehensive university known for its strengths in education and the humanities.",
